hwlogo (1.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: hwlogo-restore.service ran /usr/local/bin/hwlogo, a path the package
    never installs (it installs /usr/bin/hwlogo), so enabling the unit failed.
    ExecStart is now /usr/bin/hwlogo, and hwlogo-healthcheck checks that the
    unit's binary actually exists.
  * New: scripts/ - one-command install (build + apt install + verification,
    with --dry-run/--skip-build/--force), uninstall, and hwlogo-healthcheck
    (module loaded and signed, LED device present, EC state sane, unit path
    sane; --test additionally toggles the light and restores it).
  * build-deb.sh now writes the package to dist/ instead of the parent directory.
  * Docs: discovery notes in English (docs/discovery.md); the Russian original
    is kept as docs/discovery.ru.md.

 -- Yegor Chuperka <yegor-chuperka@yandex.ru>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 22:40:00 +0200

hwlogo (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New: GNOME Shell extension hwlogo@fstronin with a Quick Settings tile and
    a panel indicator for the lid logo light.  Installed to
    /usr/share/gnome-shell/extensions/, enabled per user with
    "gnome-extensions enable hwlogo@fstronin" (one log out / log in on Wayland).
  * README: GNOME integration and keyboard shortcut sections.

 -- Yegor Chuperka <yegor-chuperka@yandex.ru>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 02:20:00 +0200

